{"product_id":"ultimate-interview-make-a-great-impression-and-get-that-job","title":"Ultimate Interview: Make a Great Impression and Get That Job","description":"\u003cp\u003eUnique among interview guidebooks, Ultimate Interview organizes common interview questions according to specific job types, such as management, sales and marketing, administrative, clerical. This helps interviewees focus on the questions that are most relevant to their situation. Each section looks at the thinking behind the questions, and suggests an effective method of answering.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 174 x 230\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Lynn Williams\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780749453879\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 256\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45487647522969,"sku":"11RG9780749453879","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68591fa46e71d_Ultimate_Interview-_Make_a_Great_Impression_and_Get_That_Job_Lynn_Williams.jpg?v=1750689156","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/ultimate-interview-make-a-great-impression-and-get-that-job","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}